<deviceset name="WAVESHARE_5IN_HDMI_LCD_H" prefix="LCD" uservalue="yes">
<description>&lt;b&gt;Waveshare 5inch HDMI LCD (H): 800x480 TFT, 5-point capacitive USB touch, toughened glass, RTD2660 scaler. D2K upper screen. PCB/glass 121 x 76 mm, holes 109 x 84.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Connector pin = signal:&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;HDMI&lt;/b&gt; (HDMI type A (Display)): 1=TMDS_D2+, 2=TMDS_D2_SH, 3=TMDS_D2-, 4=TMDS_D1+, 5=TMDS_D1_SH, 6=TMDS_D1-, 7=TMDS_D0+, 8=TMDS_D0_SH, 9=TMDS_D0-, 10=TMDS_CLK+, 11=TMDS_CLK_SH, 12=TMDS_CLK-, 13=CEC, 14=UTILITY, 15=DDC_SCL, 16=DDC_SDA, 17=DDC_GND, 18=+5V, 19=HPD&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;TOUCH&lt;/b&gt; (micro-USB Touch): 1=VBUS, 2=D-, 3=D+, 5=GND, 4=ID&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;DC&lt;/b&gt; (micro-USB DC power): 1=VBUS, 5=GND&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;AUDIO&lt;/b&gt; (3.5 mm jack): T=L, R=R, S=GND&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;SPK&lt;/b&gt; (Speaker header 4p): 1=SPK1, 2=SPK2, 3=SPK3, 4=SPK4</description>
<gates>
