<text x="-40.64" y="35.56" size="3.81" layer="94">D2K V1 - 1/3 Pi 5 and screens</text>
<text x="-40.64" y="29.21" size="1.778" layer="97">Raspberry Pi 5 on mains USB-C + Waveshare 5inch HDMI LCD (H) upper + Waveshare 4-DSI-TOUCH-A lower touch</text>
<text x="-40.64" y="-195.58" size="1.27" layer="97">Generated by fusion/electronics/gen_d2k_v1_sch.py - warnings and cable details: fusion/wiring.md</text>
<text x="-40.64" y="-200.66" size="1.27" layer="97">Unused: Pi HDMI1, DISP0, USB3, Ethernet; 5in DC micro-USB, VGA, speaker header. Pi USB2_1: ESP32 (sheet 2).</text>
